<description>
This PR kills 3 mutants from https://mutanthub.space/mutants in validation.cpp
I batched them together because the assertions are within the same test

Mutants killed:

Mutant 4388: validation.cpp ActivateBestChains, && → ||

```diff
@@ -6482,7 +6482,7 @@ util::Result<void> ChainstateManager::ActivateBestChains()
         for (const auto& chainstate : m_chainstates) {
-            if (chainstate && chainstate->m_assumeutxo != Assumeutxo::INVALID && !chainstate->m_target_utxohash) {
+            if (chainstate || chainstate->m_assumeutxo != Assumeutxo::INVALID && !chainstate->m_target_utxohash) {
                 chainstates.push_back(chainstate.get());
```

Mutant 4385: validation.cpp GetPruneRange, + 1 → - 1

```diff
@@ -6447,7 +6447,7 @@ std::pair<int, int> Chainstate::GetPruneRange(int last_height_can_prune) const
-        prune_start = Assert(SnapshotBase())->nHeight + 1;
+        prune_start = Assert(SnapshotBase())->nHeight - 1;
```

Mutant 4386: validation.cpp GetPruneRange, - → + MIN_BLOCKS_TO_KEEP

```diff
@@ -6451,7 +6451,7 @@ std::pair<int, int> Chainstate::GetPruneRange(int last_height_can_prune) const
     int max_prune = std::max<int>(
-        0, m_chain.Height() - static_cast<int>(MIN_BLOCKS_TO_KEEP));
+        0, m_chain.Height() + static_cast<int>(MIN_BLOCKS_TO_KEEP));
```
</description>

