d8a6314193 test: check ActivateBestChains skips validated chainstate

catches validated chainstates being passed
to ActivateBestChains, which previously went undetected.

kills mutant https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4388

diff --git a/src/validation.cpp b/src/validation.cpp
index 6bed39ba5f..d965254192 100644
--- a/src/validation.cpp
+++ b/src/validation.cpp
@@ -6482,7 +6482,7 @@ util::Result<void> ChainstateManager::ActivateBestChains()
         LOCK(GetMutex());
         chainstates.reserve(m_chainstates.size());
         for (const auto& chainstate : m_chainstates) {
-            if (chainstate && chainstate->m_assumeutxo != Assumeutxo::INVALID && !chainstate->m_target_utxohash) {
+            if (chainstate || chainstate->m_assumeutxo != Assumeutxo::INVALID && !chainstate->m_target_utxohash) {
                 chainstates.push_back(chainstate.get());
             }
         }

190f103a63 test: check GetPruneRange on unvalidated snapshot

kills mutants https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4385 and
https://mutanthub.space/mutants/4386

checks prune range before a snapshot chain gets validated
ensures that pruning does not start before the snapshot block or
within the last 288 blocks.

diff --git a/src/validation.cpp b/src/validation.cpp
index 6bed39ba5f..a51e1595aa 100644
--- a/src/validation.cpp
+++ b/src/validation.cpp
@@ -6447,7 +6447,7 @@ std::pair<int, int> Chainstate::GetPruneRange(int last_height_can_prune) const
